ction>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-657701e elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"657701e\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-212b371\" data-id=\"212b371\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6d7f565 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6d7f565\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<strong><a href=\"\/saudiarabia\/en\/services\/\">Services<\/a><\/strong> \/ Managing Investments\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-536db28 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"536db28\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-4e8d365\" data-id=\"4e8d365\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-da85041 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"da85041\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tArqaam Capital offers comprehensive \u2018Managing Investments\u2019 services, as defined and regulated by the Saudi Capital Market Authority (CMA). Our arranging activities encompass a broad spectrum of services related to managing investments, including asset management, investment funds, and Discretionary Portfolio Management (DPM) services.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-72129cb elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"72129cb\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-b1db2ac\" data-id=\"b1db2ac\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0f341a9 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0f341a9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tKey Aspects of Managing Investments Services\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-89d2457\" data-id=\"89d2457\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3d0911c elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3d0911c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tManaging Investments (M1): In compliance with the Managing Investments License, Arqaam handles various aspects of fund and discretionary portfolio management. This includes the rigorous application of investment strategies, continuous risk assessment, and the observance of ethical investment practices that prioritize client interests and regulatory compliance.\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1a4e076 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1a4e076\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Equities Asset Management<\/b>: Managing funds and discretionary portfolios focusing on publicly listed and traded regional equity securities.<\/p><p><b>Fixed Income Asset Management<\/b>: Managing funds and discretionary portfolios focusing on regional bonds and sukuks (conventional and Shari\u2019ah).<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-a74e3e8 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"a74e3e8\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-35d0c75\" data-id=\"35d0c75\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f6e330c elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f6e330c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThe DPM process\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-e74c52b\" data-id=\"e74c52b\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-29cf514 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"29cf514\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Arqaam Capital&#8217;s Discretionary Portfolio Management (DPM) services commence with a detailed initial consultation where client-specific financial objectives, investment experience, and risk appetite are thoroughly understood. This understanding shapes the drafting of an Investment Policy Statement (IPS), which outlines tailored investment strategies and objectives. Following client agreement on the IPS, Arqaam guides clients through the account setup and asset transfer process, ensuring all legal and compliance documents are appropriately managed. Assets are then aligned with the IPS through strategic rebalancing to match the client\u2019s risk tolerance and investment goals. Arqaam\u2019s ongoing management involves proactive portfolio adjustments in response to market changes and regular performance reviews with the client to ensure alignment with the evolving financial goals and market conditions. This continuous cycle of management and communication upholds Arqaam\u2019s commitment to achieving clients\u2019 investment objectives while maintaining the highest standards of transparency and regulatory compliance.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-28bdd09 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"28bdd09\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7e1ca8f\" data-id=\"7e1ca8f\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4835163 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4835163\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAsset Management\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-b5d5aec\" data-id=\"b5d5aec\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-73d2432 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"73d2432\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tManaging Investments involves overseeing the comprehensive management of client assets and DPM\u2019s in alignment with tailored investment mandates. This pivotal position within the company includes several critical duties and activities:\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-de11a3e elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"de11a3e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Portfolio Management:<\/b> Direct responsibility for the construction, management, and oversight of client investment portfolios, ensuring they align with agreed-upon strategies and client objectives.<\/p>\n<p><b><br>Client Relationship Management:<\/b> Engage actively with clients to review investment strategies, manage expectations, and adapt portfolios based on changing client needs and market conditions.<br><br><b>Business Development:<\/b> Source new clients and opportunities to expand the assets under management (AuM), leveraging industry networks and client referrals.<br><br><b>Performance Monitoring:<\/b> Oversee the monitoring and analysis of portfolio performances against benchmarks, making strategic adjustments to maximize returns and minimize risks.<br><br><b>Regulatory Compliance and Reporting:<\/b> Ensure all portfolio management activities comply with regulatory requirements, preparing and presenting regular reports to senior management and regulatory bodies.<br><br><b>Risk Management:<\/b> Implement robust risk management strategies to identify, assess, and mitigate investment risks associated with client portfolios.<br><br><b>Client Servicing and Retention: <\/b>Manage client satisfaction through regular updates, meetings, and reports, addressing any concerns and ensuring a high standard of client service<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>MANAGING INVESTMENTS Services \/ Managing InvestmentsArqaam Capital offers comprehensive \u2018Managing Investments\u2019 services, as defined and regulated by the Saudi Capital Market Authority (CMA). Our arranging activities encompass a broad spectrum of services related to managing investments, including asset management, investment funds, and Discretionary Portfolio Management (DPM) services.Key Aspects of Managing Investments ServicesManaging Investments (M1): In [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"page-full-width.php","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-20321","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.arqaamcapital.com\/saudiarabia\/en\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/20321","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.arqaamcapital.com\/saudiarabia\/en\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.arqaamcapital.com\/saudiarabia\/en\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.arqaamcapital.com\/saudiarabia\/en\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.arqaamcapital.com\/saudiarabia\/en\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=20321"}],"version-history":[{"count":34,"href":"https:\/\/www.arqaamcapital.com\/saudiarabia\/en\/